      say: `The kit holds six workflow files. Two joiners: a pre-hire workflow that sends the pass seven days before day one, and a day-one workflow that requests the onboarding package. A mover on the organization code. And three leavers, including a post-separation delete thirty days after the leave date. All of them scope on the employee type and a worker type code, never on a name. The day-one workflow doesn't enable the account; the pipeline is that writer, as Chapter 1's register records. And each file records its version, owner and execution limit.`,
