      detail: `You need Python 3.10 or later. Work in examples/hr-lifecycle. Step 1, list the reads and their permissions: python python/graph_export.py --task joiner-plan --list gives Task joiner-plan: LifecycleWorkflows-Workflow.Read.All, GET /identityGovernance/lifecycleWorkflows/workflows. python python/graph_export.py --task joiner-readiness --list gives EntitlementManagement.Read.All, LifecycleWorkflows-Reports.Read.All, User-LifeCycleInfo.Read.All, User.Read.All: GET /users, GET …/workflows/{workflowId}/userProcessingResults, GET /identityGovernance/entitlementManagement/assignments. Step 2, lint the program's workflows: python python/joiner_workflows.py lint config/workflows --budget 50 gives Workflows: 6 files, budget 50; Lint: 0 Finding, 0 Warn, 0 Info.`,
