      say: `Step three lints three broken copies, with a budget of two so the ceiling rule fires. Seven findings and four warnings. The day-one copy has an offset of two hundred days and adds the user to groups directly. The leaver triggers on the hire date, deletes and disables in one workflow, and scopes on the manager, which Learn doesn't list. The pre-hire copy has no execution limit, scopes on a department name, and sends a three-day pass that isn't one-time use. The exit code is two.`,
