      say: `Step four plans against the tenant's export. The day-one workflow in the tenant requests a different package, so it gets a new version. The employee leaver doesn't exist yet, so it gets a create. The one warning is a legacy workflow made in the portal that no file defines. Nothing is sent. Plan the broken folder and it refuses. Step five measures day one: one of four hires ready. One lacks only the package, one is disabled and unlicensed, and one has no account at all. The fifty-seven tests pass.`,
